                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (X_J,\mathcal{A}_J)
              the categorical
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/product"} product
              of the
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi X
