            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Markov+category#kolmogorov_products"} Markov category - Kolmogorov products
            for more on this, as well as
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#fritzrischel"} Fritz-Rischel’20
